  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Haitian Youth Peace Building Initiative in Bel-Air and Saint Martin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young people in Saint Martin, Bel Air, and Nan Cocteau neighborhoods on the periphery of the Haitian capital city of Port-au-Prince face violence that affects their livelihoods. Lakou Lap provides technical assistance to a network of young people to develop vocational and conflict management skills that enable them to develop community-based responses to violence. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to enhance peace and security in Haiti. Lakou Lap&apos;s activities strengthen communities through education and training and build peer-to-peer learning and action networks.</narrative>
  </description>
